Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.00,Sign,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.59,0:00:23.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure is hot today...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.25,0:00:28.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You really don't feel like doing much \Nof anything when it's this hot. {????????}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.48,0:00:30.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, all because of the heat...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.69,0:00:34.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, I even brought out \Nthe shogi board, but then again—
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.08,0:00:36.62,Default,,0,0,0,,there's no one to play with 'cause of the heat!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.62,0:00:38.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Or maybe there {\i1}is{\i0} someone? {a cat is fine too}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.76,0:00:43.20,Default,,0,0,0,,How about him?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.80,0:00:54.04,Default,,0,0,0,,There we go! {???? dekita}{isn't it "hoi kita"}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.21,0:00:56.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.73,0:00:57.48,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.48,0:00:58.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Wanna play a match?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.21,0:01:00.17,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.55,0:01:05.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, that is a bold move right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.61,0:01:06.56,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.56,0:01:08.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe go here next?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.52,0:01:11.47,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a decent trade. {?????}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.15,0:01:15.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, he's pretty good at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.83,0:01:17.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, this is my response.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.33,0:01:20.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.88,0:01:21.42,Overlap,,0,0,0,,Here. Like this, see? {????}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.42,0:01:23.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Then how about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.76,0:01:27.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that's some mighty fine playing!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.18,0:01:29.84,Default,,0,0,0,,There!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.22,0:01:31.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Check!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.83,0:01:34.84,Sign,,0,0,0,,King
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.35,0:01:32.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I give up!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.13,0:01:41.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{?????}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.84,0:01:44.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, he's damn strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.24,0:01:48.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Too strong for me. \NMaybe there's someone a tad weaker around?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.09,0:01:50.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah... Someone weaker...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.68,0:01:59.47,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.07,0:02:01.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.18,0:02:04.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Wh-What was that? What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.38,0:02:05.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone is... {?????}{hear "hito" somewhere around the end}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.47,0:02:05.92,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.92,0:02:07.20,Default,,0,0,0,,So creepy!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.79,0:02:13.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh? A mosquito? \NNo, rather, a midge. {???????}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.46,0:02:22.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa! A beauty!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.90,0:02:30.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I'll be...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.60,0:02:36.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a pretty thing, you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.73,0:02:40.72,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.72,0:02:42.54,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.53,0:02:46.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh! You're devilishly alluring! {??????? yokoshima is "wicked; evil; wrong; bad" but idk what he means; he later uses it again so it's defo yokoshima}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.41,0:02:48.01,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.28,0:02:51.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You're so naughty...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.72,0:02:53.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no, it's just that you...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.30,0:03:06.69,Default,,0,0,0,,This is irresistible...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.18,0:03:11.30,Default,,0,0,0,,O-Ow! Ow-ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.30,0:03:16.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Ow! Help me! I ended up \Nletting her suck my blood out!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.28,0:03:18.33,Default,,0,0,0,,This love was devilish indeed! {???}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.27,0:03:22.73,Default,,0,0,0,,What a useless man...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.41,0:03:32.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, sure is hot today...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.62,0:03:35.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is it so hot?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.04,0:03:39.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh geez... The wind is so unkind to us today. {???}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.29,0:03:41.77,Default,,0,0,0,,So hot...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.75,0:03:45.83,Default,,0,0,0,,It's unbearable... \NI'm drenched in sweat. {muzu please control yourself}{hot and humid; muggy; sultry}{moist and squishy}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.72,0:03:49.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't stand it. \NWe've gotta do something...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.77,0:03:58.74,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right, let's go to the Wind Hermit.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.08,0:04:17.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I beg your pardon, Wind Hermit?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.50,0:04:20.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, Wind Hermit... {???? no clue what's that fuusen, maybe she combined kaze and sennin into fuusen?}{風仙}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.59,0:04:25.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, wake up, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.56,0:04:26.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.40,0:04:27.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Quick...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.48,0:04:28.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, tickle-tickle.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.82,0:04:31.90,Default,,0,0,0,,P-Please, I can't eat more... Just one more...{??????}{もう食うえんぞ，もういっかい}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.26,0:04:33.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.95,0:04:35.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Please...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.14,0:04:42.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Wh-Wh-What's going on? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.36,0:04:45.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, the heat is unbearable today.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.52,0:04:48.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Please blow a little wind for us, won't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.19,0:04:49.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, sure. No problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.88,0:04:52.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Here I go, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.09,0:04:53.22,Default,,0,0,0,,How about it? {??}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.83,0:05:01.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, that's better...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.26,0:05:03.10,Overlap,,0,0,0,,Feels so good!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.45,0:05:04.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'm happy too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.10,0:05:17.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, husband!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.56,0:05:20.85,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that you're doing, at your age?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.85,0:05:23.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, you see, wife, I was actually just...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.58,0:05:25.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Spare me your excuses!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.25,0:05:27.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you cool down \Nyour head a bit instead?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.83,0:05:29.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Like, for example, with this!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.50,0:05:30.00,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.00,0:05:31.25,Default,,0,0,0,,H-Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.25,0:05:34.51,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I mean... \NYour hair is blowing such a cold wind! {??}{sotoo: line 91: i think the joke is "kami-kaze"... not sure what would be a good translation though beyond just referencing "Divine Wind" or something? since they are "gods" too}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.51,0:05:37.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! My head feels weird \Nwhen you blow towards me... Hey! {?????????}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.65,0:05:40.57,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.85,0:07:21.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Come, come...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.94,0:07:35.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, don't you like it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.83,0:07:44.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.46,0:07:53.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.22,0:08:06.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I only came here to quickly wet my throat, \Nbut when the sake is good, it's real good. {menaing he stayed because the sake was so good}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.19,0:08:14.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Missy, I'll have one more.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.48,0:08:16.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe... {????}{kamo ne; think she's jsut playfully teasing him like "maybe I'll bring you another one, maybe I won't, teehee"}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.49,0:08:22.49,Default,,0,0,0,,One turns into two.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.99,0:08:25.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Two turn into four...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.36,0:08:28.35,Default,,0,0,0,,No, four turn into eight.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.35,0:08:32.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Eight turn into sixteen, \Nbut I'll have just one more.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.84,0:08:36.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Just one more.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.18,0:08:38.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, one more!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.14,0:08:40.15,Default,,0,0,0,,M-More...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.43,0:08:43.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, gosh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.40,0:08:47.32,Default,,0,0,0,,So he's finally turned into a tiger?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.40,0:08:47.32,Note,,0,0,0,,[tora = tiger (primary meaning) / drunkard (colloquial meaning)]
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.32,0:08:49.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you even get home when you're so drunk?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.39,0:08:52.45,Default,,0,0,0,,It's fine, I'll get home, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.15,0:08:56.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Your house is that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.03,0:09:06.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Take care!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.99,0:09:09.72,Default,,0,0,0,,That hit home...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.01,0:09:27.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you been drinking again?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.78,0:09:42.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.75,0:09:55.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Been drinking again?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.89,0:09:57.69,Overlap,,0,0,0,,Been drinking again?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.69,0:09:59.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Been drinking again?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.97,0:10:06.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm seeing things...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.43,0:10:08.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Been drinking again?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.37,0:10:14.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Been drinking again?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.91,0:10:33.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Why should I be scared of my own wife?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.08,0:10:35.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not scared!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.42,0:10:41.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm scared...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.23,0:10:45.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom... {this was so funny to me for some reason}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.88,0:10:47.82,Default,,0,0,0,,forgive me...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.99,0:11:13.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess not...
